OL,3,GNEWSASculpting sandcastles 'more tiring
OL,4,Athan you think'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman competing on a new BBC show in
OL,7,Fwhich competitors sculpt sand art said
OL,8,Fit was a "brilliant" and "tiring"
OL,9,Fexperience.
OL,11,FAthena Cauley Yu runs a stationery and
OL,12,Fcalligraphy business in Bath, Somerset,
OL,13,Fand features in BBC Two's Race Against
OL,14,Fthe Tide alongside professional sand
OL,15,Fsculptor Rachel Stubbs.
OL,17,FThe series sees seven teams battle it
OL,18,Fout to build spectacular sand
OL,19,Fsculptures before the tide washes them
OL,20,Faway in St Andrews, Scotland, with all
OL,21,Fepisodes available on BBC iPlayer.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
